---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Beacon Studio">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <p style="text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #8d5e37;">Growth systems</p>
      <h1>Make launch, reporting, and campaign operations easier to trust.</h1>
      <p>
        The brand shell is already here. The resources section and contact flows
        are the missing parts that need to feel native to the existing site.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="grid two">
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>Resources</h2>
        <p>We want a lightweight resources hub that looks production-ready, not like a side project.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h2>Contact paths</h2>
        <p>Marketing wants separate contact and demo flows, but the UX should still feel cohesive.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
